# Bake the populated SQLite metadata DB into the image. Image binaries
# live on R2; this file only holds row metadata (~tens of MB).
# WAL/SHM/journal sidecars are still excluded — a half-flushed write
# must never be baked in.data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
